---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="About: Todd Ables"
  description="Todd Ables has spent 12+ years designing software and then building it, mostly tools for the people who use them all day."
>
  <article class="page">
    <h1>Hi, I’m Todd.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      For 12+ years I’ve designed software and then built it, mostly tools for the people who use them all day.
    </p>
    <p>
      I studied computer science at Oklahoma State, then went to SMU Guildhall for game design. There I built levels,
      designed UI and boss encounters, and shipped team games with designers, artists, and programmers. Guildhall also
      trained producers alongside the developers, and watching that side of the work is where my interest in product
      started.
    </p>
    <p>
      Since then I’ve worked in consulting, payments, public safety, and finance. The job has looked about the same in
      each place: talk with the people who will use something, design it, build it, and keep improving it after launch.
    </p>
    <p>
      The work I go deepest on is design systems. Tokens, components, and the standards that let a lot of developers
      build consistent UI quickly. Most of that work has been private, so this site is where I start showing how I think
      about it, out in the open.
    </p>
    <p>
      I live in Fort Worth, Texas, with my wife, our two kids, two cats, and a bearded dragon. We’re planning a move to
      the Pacific Northwest.
    </p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href={SITE.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-outbound="repo">
        This site’s repo ↗
      </a>
      <a href={SITE.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-outbound="linkedin">
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
      <a href="/build-log">Build log →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
